  "title": "NEW! Amex is offering a 30% transfer bonus to Virgin Atlantic",
  "summary": "American Express is offering a 30% transfer bonus to Virgin Atlantic Flying Club through July 31, 2026, updating the conversion ratio to 1:1.3. This promotion drops the cost of luxury ANA First Class flights down to just 56,000 Amex points, making a premium first class ticket cheaper than a regularly priced business class award.",
